! Supplementary material for:
! A kinetic mechanism for the thermal decomposition of titanium tetraisopropoxide
! 
! Philipp Buerger (a), Daniel Nurkowski (a), Jethro Akroyd (a, b), and Markus Kraft (a, b, c, *)
! 
! (a) Department of Chemical Engineering and Biotechnology, University of Cambridge, New Museums Site, 
!     Pembroke Street, Cambridge CB2 3RA, United Kingdom
! (b) Cambridge Centre for Carbon Reduction in Chemical Technologies (CARES C4T), #05-05 CREATE Tower, 
!     1 CREATE Way, Singapore 138602
! (c) School of Chemical and Biomedical Engineering, Nanyang Technological University, 
!     62 Nanyang Drive, Singapore 637459
!
! (*) To whom the correspondence should be addressed
! 
! Description: This mechanism was used to explore the sensitivity of TTIP ignition delay simulations
! to various rate parameters. It describes the thermal decomposition of titanium tetraisopropoxide 
! via a direct analogy with the mechanism proposed by Johnson et al. [29] and also includes representative 
! hydrolysis reactions. The corresponding reaction rate was taken from Shmakov et al. [25]. A 1000-fold
! increase in the rates of the CH3 radical abstraction reactions from the isopropoxide branch was 
! required to achieve any form of agreement with the ignition delay data from the experimental work
! of Abdali et al. [51].
!
! [25] A. G. Shmakov, O. P. Korobeinichev, D. A. Knyazkov, A. A. Paletsky,
! R. A. Maksutov, I. E. Gerasimov, T. A. Bolshova, V. G. Kiselev, N. P.
! Gritsan, Proc. Combust. Inst. 34 (2013) 1143–1149.
!
! [29] M. V. Johnson, S. S. Goldsborough, Z. Serinyel, P. O’Toole, E. Larkin,
! G. O’Malley, H. J. Curran, Energy Fuels 23 (2009) 5886–5898
!
! [30] J. Park, R. S. Zhu, M. C. Lin, J. Chem. Phys. 117 (2002) 3224-3231
!
! [31] H.-B. Rao, X.-Y. Zeng, H. He, Z.-R. Li, J. Phys. Chem. A 115 (2011) 1602-1608
!
! [51] A. Abdali, M. Fikri, H. Orthner, H.Wiggers, C. Schulz, Chem. Phys.
! Lett. 601 (2014) 54–58.
!
! Paper reference: P. Buerger, D. Nurkowski, J. Akroyd, and M. Kraft, A kinetic mechanism for the thermal 
! decomposition of titanium tetraisopropoxide, Proc. Combust. Inst. 36, 2016
!
! Date: 03 Dec 2015
! E-mail: mk306@cam.ac.uk
!
! Changes: 
! 09 Nov 2016 - The numbers of the references used within this file have been amended to be consistent with those 
! used in the accepted publication.

ELEMENTS
C  H  O  N  TI  AR  NE  HE  
END

